      "summary": "The article highlights the distinct failure modes of large language models (LLMs) and draws parallels to journalistic practices that ensure information reliability. By understanding these failure modes, developers can implement structured solutions to improve AI trustworthiness in various applications, particularly in high-stakes environments.",
